# .cursorignore — shrink Cursor indexing and AI context surface.
#
# Rationale: Cursor uses ignore files to control what files are available to AI features
# and indexing. Indexing large archival / generated / fixture directories dilutes
# retrieval quality and wastes context/index budget on content Cursor should not
# read during live work.
#
# Pattern rules follow .gitignore syntax. Paths are relative to repo root.
# Keep this file terse; add exclusions only after observing repeated noise,
# not prospectively.
#
# References:
#   - .windsurf/rules/scope-containment.md
#   - .windsurf/plans/llm-containment-hooks-rules-c7a91b.md
#   - https://cursor.com/docs/reference/ignore-file

# --- Archives / tombstoned code -----------------------------------------------
archives/
**/archives/
**/_archived/
**/_archived_obsolete/
**/_deleted/
**/_oneoff/
**/_oneshot/
# S-11: ADG backup archives that accumulate grep noise (per adg-config-ssot-audit-c7e4a2)
**/adg_root_oneshots_*/
**/adg_backups/
**/tools_graveyard_*/

# --- Generated reports (humans read these; Cursor should not index them) ----
reports/
docs/reports/
**/reports/

# --- Raw data / fixtures ------------------------------------------------------
data/
**/data/sample_*/
**/data/**/*.json
!apps_shared/data/master_resume.json
**/data/**/*.csv
**/data/**/*.parquet
**/fixtures/

# --- Artifacts (build outputs, snapshots, capture logs) ----------------------
# NOTE: artifacts/adg/adg_indexed_*.sqlite is the canonical ADG snapshot.
# We DO NOT ignore it — Cursor must reach it for dependency queries.
# Everything else under artifacts/ is generated and safe to skip.
artifacts/capture/
artifacts/windsurf/
artifacts/memory/
artifacts/ledgers/
artifacts/requirements/
artifacts/**/*.jsonl
artifacts/**/*.log

# --- Python / tooling caches --------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/

# --- Virtualenvs / dependencies ----------------------------------------------
.venv/
venv/
env/
node_modules/

# --- IDE / OS junk ------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo

# --- Logs / tmp ---------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
tmp/
.tmp/
.playwright-mcp/

